---
<section class="framework-section bg-white">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-left">
        <h2 class="section-title">Markets Evolves. Leadership shifts. Opportunities rotate.</h2>
        <p class="font-secondary intro-text">
          The Karma Wealth Builder strategy is designed to remain agile - never confined to a single market segment or rigid sector allocation. We invest across the breadth of the equity market, with a preference for businesses that are established leaders or emerging leaders within their industries.
        </p>
        <p class="font-secondary intro-text" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
          With the flexibility to move across market-cap segments, the strategy focuses capital where we see the greatest combination of growth potential, business quality, and valuation opportunity.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="col-right">
        <div class="architecture-list">
          <div class="architecture-item">
            <div class="item-number font-secondary">01</div>
            <div class="item-content">
              <h4>All Cap Flexibility</h4>
              <p class="font-secondary">Do not invest according to predefined market-cap allocations. Large, mid, and small-cap businesses are considered on their individual merits. Capital is directed toward the opportunities where our conviction is highest and the risk-reward is most compelling.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="architecture-item">
            <div class="item-number font-secondary">02</div>
            <div class="item-content">
              <h4>Growth at a Reasonable Price</h4>
              <p class="font-secondary">Seek businesses capable of delivering durable earnings growth without paying an excessive price for that growth. GARP approach combines rigorous fundamental research with valuation discipline and a strong focus on financial quality.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="architecture-item">
            <div class="item-number font-secondary">03</div>
            <div class="item-content">
              <h4>Early Cycle Investing</h4>
              <p class="font-secondary">We seek to identify and invest in businesses at early inflection points in their growth, transformation or recovery cycles, ahead of broader market recognition.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="architecture-item">
            <div class="item-number font-secondary">04</div>
            <div class="item-content">
              <h4>High-Conviction. Benchmark agnostic</h4>
              <p class="font-secondary">Eliminate noise and maintain a focused portfolio of 20–25 businesses. Each position is backed by deep fundamental research, strong business fundamentals, and a clearly defined investment thesis without the constraints of benchmark weights.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="architecture-item">
            <div class="item-number font-secondary">05</div>
            <div class="item-content">
              <h4>High Active Share</h4>
              <p class="font-secondary">Deliberately build differentiated portfolio to maintain high active share, allowing our strongest investment ideas to meaningfully shape outcomes.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style lang="scss">
  .framework-section {
    padding: 8rem 0;
    background-color: #f8f9fa; /* Very light grey/white background */
  }
  
  .row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 6rem;
    
    @media (max-width: 992px) {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 3rem;
    }
  }
  
  .col-left {
    flex: 1;
    max-width: 450px;
    position: sticky;
    top: 120px;
    align-self: flex-start;
    
    @media (max-width: 992px) {
      max-width: 100%;
      position: relative;
      top: 0;
    }
  }
  
  .col-right {
    flex: 1.5;
  }
  
  .framework-subtitle {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    color: #17a2b8; /* Cyan accent color */
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  
  .section-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: #000000; /* Black heading */
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .sub-heading {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #333;
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  
  .intro-text {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #555;
    margin: 0;
  }
  
  .architecture-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  
  .architecture-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    padding: 3rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    
    &:first-child {
      padding-top: 0;
    }
    
    &:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
      padding-bottom: 0;
    }
    
    @media (max-width: 576px) {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1rem;
      padding: 2rem 0;
    }
  }
  
  .item-number {
    font-size: 2rem !important;
    font-weight: 300 !important;
    color: #75b0e2 !important; /* Blue to match WhyKarma.astro */
    margin-top: -0.2rem; /* Slight adjustment to align baseline with heading */
  }
  
  .item-content {
    h4 {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: #001b3a;
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    
    p {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: #666;
      margin: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
